# Local deployment config, copied from config.yaml.example per the README. Holds a real
# AWS account number and profile name, so it must not be committed. Leading slash keeps
# this to the repo root -- projects/api/config.yaml and projects/eval/config.yaml are
# tracked, environment-independent, and intentionally so.
/config.yaml
